# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Lainemap long perspektiv (wetem rotesen)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama we i raon olsem silinda
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Tekemaot ol sado blong samting we i muv (fas foto i refarens)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Focal length (px) / bigfala blong image (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Foto blong fokus i yusum ol layer mask we yu save editim. Jusum wan mask long Layers mo pentem blong stretem.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = I no faenem wan stret lainemap. Yusum ol foto we i gat plante ditel, oli kavremap sem ples plante, mo lukluk i no jenisim tumas.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Ol foto blong stat o ol setting blong joenem oli no stret.
